    "## What you'll see\n",
    "\n",
    "Daily check-in tab now has:\n",
    "- Left column: pill organizer photo (unchanged)\n",
    "- Right column: TWO sub-tabs — **⌨️ Type** and **🎙️ Speak**\n",
    "\n",
    "Speak tab supports microphone recording in the browser AND file upload. After clicking 'Transcribe and log':\n",
    "1. Gemma 4 transcribes the audio → 'What NaniGPT heard' textbox shows the transcript\n",
