    "**Demo flow for the video:** point the phone at the organizer (Tab 1, left), then talk to your laptop microphone like a tired caregiver at 11pm (Tab 1, right, Speak). The agent does both — same model, same architecture, four uses of Gemma 4 in two screens.\n"
